<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch SNS and Reaal complete bank/insurance merger.</title>
<headline>Dutch SNS and Reaal complete bank/insurance merger.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unlisted SNS Groep NV and Reaal Groep NV said on Tuesday the planned merger between the two had been completed.</p>
<p>SNS, mainly a banking group, and Reaal, mainly an insurer, said last November they planned to merge.</p>
<p>The new &quot;all finance&quot; group will operate under the name SNS Reaal Groep NV, with headquarters in Den Bosch and a combined staff of 4.700 people.</p>
<p>It said SNS Reaal Group's proforma 1996 net profit was 213 million guilders and added that profit growth was expected to continue in the coming years.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
